{
    "info": {
        "_postman_id": "85f645bd-bf14-5059-add2-6d079828ddab",
        "name": "Guatemala - Payin",
        "description": "# JavaCash Payin\n\nEste endpoint permite generar un **Payin** utilizando la plataforma **JavaCash**. Su funcion principal es facilitar la creacion de una transaccion segura y eficiente, donde los usuarios pueden realizar pagos de manera rapida y confiable.\n\n## Autorizacion\n\nDebes enviar el parametro **x-api-key** en los **HEADERS** con la **API KEY** del usuario.\n\n### Error de autorizacion respuesta\n\nSi falta una clave API, esta mal formada o no es valida, recibiras un codigo de respuesta HTTP 401 No autorizado.",
        "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
        "_exporter_id": "30722009"
    },
    "item": [
        {
            "name": "payIn",
            "item": [
                {
                    "name": "Registrar",
                    "event": [
                        {
                            "listen": "test",
                            "script": {
                                "exec": [""],
                                "type": "text/javascript",
                                "packages": {},
                                "requests": {}
                            }
                        }
                    ],
                    "request": {
                        "method": "POST",
                        "header": [
                            {
                                "key": "Content-Type",
                                "value": "application/json"
                            }
                        ],
                        "body": {
                            "mode": "raw",
                            "raw": "{\n  \"customId\": 1,\n  \"currency\": \"GTQ\",\n  \"amount\": \"100\",\n  \"userName\": \"Jose perez\",\n  \"userPhone\": \"51234567\",\n  \"userEmail\": \"prueba@email.com\",\n  \"userIdentificationNumber\": \"1234567890101\",\n  \"dueDate\": \"2027/12/30\"\n}"
                        },
                        "url": {
                            "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/payin/register",
                            "host": [
                                "{{baseUrl}}"
                            ],
                            "path": [
                                "api",
                                "payin",
                                "register"
                            ]
                        },
                        "description": "| Params | Type | Example | Description | Requerido |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `currency` | **String** | GTQ | Codigo de la moneda | si |\n| `amount` | **String** | 100 | Monto de la transaccion | si |\n| `customId` | **number** | 123 | Identificador personalizado | si |\n| `userName` | **String** | Jose perez | Nombre del comprador | si |\n| `userPhone` | **String** | 51234567 | Numero de telefono del comprador, evite anadir el prefijo del pais y el signo mas (+) | si |\n| `userEmail` | **String** | prueba@email.com | Correo electronico del comprador | si |\n| `userIdentificationNumber` | **String** | 1234567890101 | DPI (CUI) de 13 digitos o NIT, sin guiones | si |\n| `dueDate` | **String** | 2027/12/30 | Fecha de vencimiento del enlace de pago | si |\n\nImportante: la respuesta de 201 Created devuelve la variable checkoutUrl, esta es el link del Checkout"
                    },
                    "response": [
                        {
                            "name": "Successful Response",
                            "status": "Created",
                            "code": 201,
                            "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
                            "header": [
                                {
                                    "key": "Content-Type",
                                    "value": "application/json"
                                }
                            ],
                            "cookie": [],
                            "body": "{\n    \"success\": true,\n    \"message\": \"Transaction successfully created\",\n    \"code\": 201,\n    \"data\": {\n        \"id\": \"65baf429-9e41-44c5-bb16-5785aa087160\",\n        \"status\": \"pending\",\n        \"reference\": \"39001303\",\n        \"checkoutUrl\": \"https://guatemala.javacash.finance/checkout/65baf429-9e41-44c5-bb16-5785aa087160\",\n        \"currency\": \"GTQ\",\n        \"amount\": \"100.00\",\n        \"customId\": \"1\",\n        \"methods\": [\n            {\n                \"url\": \"https://guatemala.javacash.finance/checkout/65baf429-9e41-44c5-bb16-5785aa087160/transfer\",\n                \"name_method\": \"Transferencia bancaria\",\n                \"logo\": null\n            },\n            {\n                \"url\": \"https://guatemala.javacash.finance/checkout/65baf429-9e41-44c5-bb16-5785aa087160/efectivo\",\n                \"name_method\": \"Pago en efectivo\",\n                \"logo\": null\n            }\n        ]\n    }\n}"
